PlantUML:Use Case Diagram tổng thể
@startuml
left to right direction
actor User

rectangle "Greenhouse App" {
  (Register)
  (Login)
  (Scan Food)
  (Analyze Food)
  (Confirm Meal)
  (Update BMI / Goal)
  (View Dashboard / History)
  (Chat with AI)
}

User --> (Register)
User --> (Login)
User --> (Scan Food)
User --> (Analyze Food)
User --> (Confirm Meal)
User --> (Update BMI / Goal)
User --> (View Dashboard / History)
User --> (Chat with AI)
@enduml

Activity Diagram: đăng ký
@startuml
start
:Open register page;
:Enter email/phone/password/full_name/gender/birth_year;
if (Valid input?) then (yes)
  :POST /api/v1/register;
  if (Email or phone exists?) then (yes)
    :Show error;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Save user to DB;
    :Return success;
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  :Show validation error;
  stop
endif
@enduml

Activity Diagram: đăng nhập
@startuml
start
:Open login page;
:Enter email and password;
:POST /api/v1/login;
if (Credentials valid?) then (yes)
  :Create JWT token;
  :Return access token;
  :Store token in browser;
  stop
else (no)
  :Show login error;
  stop
endif
@enduml

Activity Diagram: scan ảnh → phân tích → xác nhận khẩu phần
@startuml
start
:Open AI scanner page;
:Upload food image;
:POST /api/v1/scan;
:Save file and return image_url;
:POST /api/v1/vision/analyze;
:AI model predict food;
:Return food_name + options;
:User choose portion or custom gram;
:POST /api/v1/vision/confirm;
:Calculate nutrition;
:Save MealLog;
stop
@enduml

Activity Diagram: cập nhật BMI / profile / mục tiêu
@startuml
start
:Open BMI/profile page;
:Enter weight, height, goal type;
if (Goal not maintain?) then (yes)
  :Enter target weight and duration;
endif
:POST /api/v1/profile/bmi;
:Calculate BMI;
:Calculate daily calorie goal;
:Save or update UserProfile;
:Return profile summary;
stop
@enduml

Activity Diagram: tải dữ liệu dashboard / history
@startuml
start
:Open dashboard or history page;
:GET /api/history/chart/{user_id};
:GET /api/history/summary/{user_id};
:GET /api/history/macros/{user_id};
:GET /api/history/logs/{user_id};
:Render charts and logs;
stop
@enduml

Class / ER Diagram (User, UserProfile, MealLog)
@startuml
class User {
  id: int
  email: str
  phone_number: str
  password_hash: str
  full_name: str
  birth_year: int
  gender: str
  created_at: datetime
}

class UserProfile {
  id: int
  user_id: int
  weight_kg: float
  height_cm: float
  current_bmi: float
  daily_calorie_goal: float
  goal_type: str
  target_weight: float
  goal_duration_months: int
  start_date: datetime
  updated_at: datetime
}

class MealLog {
  id: int
  user_id: int
  food_name: str
  calories: float
  protein_g: float
  carbs_g: float
  fat_g: float
  meal_type: str
  scanned_at: datetime
  image_url: str
  notes: str
}

User "1" -- "1" UserProfile
User "1" -- "*" MealLog
@enduml

Component / Architecture Diagram (Next.js, FastAPI, PostgreSQL...)
@startuml
component "Next.js Frontend" as FE
component "FastAPI Backend" as BE
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
component "AI Model Loader" as AI
node "Uploads Storage" as UP

FE --> BE : HTTP API
BE --> DB : SQLModel queries
BE --> AI : load model / predict
BE --> UP : save uploaded images
@enduml

Deployment Diagram (Server frontend, backend, database, storage)
@startuml
deployment "User Browser" as Browser
node "Frontend Server" as FE
node "Backend Server" as BE
database "PostgreSQL Database" as DB
node "Storage Server" as UP

Browser --> FE : HTTP
FE --> BE : API requests
BE --> DB : SQL queries
BE --> UP : upload/download images
@enduml

State Machine Diagram (Trạng thái MealLog và User session)
@startuml
state "MealLog" as ML {
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Confirmed : user confirm
  Confirmed --> Saved : save to DB
}

state "UserSession" as US {
  [*] --> Unauthenticated
  Unauthenticated --> Authenticated : login success
  Authenticated --> Unauthenticated : logout or token expiry
}
@enduml

Mermaid:Sequence Diagram: đăng ký
sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Frontend
  participant Backend
  User->>Frontend: Open register page
  Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/v1/register
  Backend->>Backend: Validate data, check unique email/phone
  Backend->>Database: Save User
  Backend->>Frontend: Return success

Mermaid:Sequence Diagram: đăng nhập
sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Frontend
  participant Backend
  User->>Frontend: Open login page
  Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/v1/login
  Backend->>Database: Find user, verify password
  Backend->>Frontend: Return access token
  Frontend->>Browser: Store token

Mermaid:Sequence Diagram: scan/analyze/confirm meal
sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Frontend
  participant Backend
  participant AIModel
  User->>Frontend: Upload food image
  Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/v1/scan
  Backend->>Backend: Save image file
  Backend->>Frontend: Return image_url
  User->>Frontend: Confirm photo
  Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/v1/vision/analyze
  Backend->>AIModel: Predict food
  AIModel-->>Backend: Return prediction
  Backend-->>Frontend: Return food options
  User->>Frontend: Confirm meal details
  Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/v1/vision/confirm
  Backend->>Database: Insert MealLog
  Backend-->>Frontend: Return result

Mermaid:Sequence Diagram: frontend fetch history/dashboard endpoints
sequenceDiagram
  participant Frontend
  participant Backend
  Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/history/chart/{user_id}
  Backend-->>Frontend: chart data
  Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/history/summary/{user_id}
  Backend-->>Frontend: summary data
  Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/history/macros/{user_id}
  Backend-->>Frontend: macros data
  Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/history/logs/{user_id}
  Backend-->>Frontend: meal logs

Mermaid:Sequence Diagram: chat AI flow
sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Frontend
  participant Backend
  participant AIService
  User->>Frontend: Send message
  Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/v1/chat
  Backend->>Database: Load user info and today meals
  Backend->>AIService: Generate reply
  AIService-->>Backend: Return response
  Backend-->>Frontend: Send reply

